# The Flutter client is never part of the web image. `COPY . .` (Dockerfile:13) would
# otherwise put mobile/ into the build context and the builder layer, and every Dart
# change would invalidate the npm-install cache. The `**/.env*` patterns above are what
# actually keep mobile/.env out; this line keeps the 75 MB of SDK output out.
mobile/
